<title>USA: Ames pleased with October sales.</title>
<headline>Ames pleased with October sales.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKY HILL, Conn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ames Department Stores Inc Thursday reported a 7.1 percent increase in October sales, noting same store sales were up 5.3 percent and saying &quot;We are extremely pleased with October sales results.&quot;</p>
<p>It stated, &quot;Sales were very strong in the home area as a result of our annual Home Event sale.  Also, apparel sales were better than expected as a result of more seasonal weather this year.&quot;</p>
<p>Ames reported sales for the four weeks, 13 weeks and 39 weeks ended Oct 26.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $174.1     $162.6	+7.1	 +5.3</p>
<p>Quarter	   $516.9     $501.6	+3.1	 +1.2</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,455.0   $1,440.0	+1.0	 -0.5</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
